1;dashPattern=8 6;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0;exitY=0.88;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="slv_dimt" target="enr_backfill"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1755" y="460"/><mxPoint x="1755" y="849"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_bf2" value="retry batch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#6A1B9A;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 6;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.3;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.3;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="enr_backfill" target="enr_rb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_swatch" value="&lt;b&gt;Màu lớp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#1565C0&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Charts public/v0 (đã test)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Charts auth/v0 (giả định)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#7B1FA2&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Orchestrator / watermark&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Secret / giả định – cần xác nhận&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#E65100&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Bronze (raw JSON + ingested_at)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#00838F&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Web API + ReccoBeats (song song)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#455A64&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Silver (fact / dim / LEFT JOIN)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#F9A825&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Gold · &lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;■&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; BI" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fontColor=#37474F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1100" width="460" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Chú giải (legend)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mũi tên liền:&lt;/b&gt; luồng chính (Charts → Bronze → extract ID → enrichment song song → Silver → Gold → BI).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mũi tên đứt cam:&lt;/b&gt; auth/v0 daily + streams — &lt;b&gt;giả định – cần xác nhận&lt;/b&gt; (Bearer user, ToS, lifetime token chưa đo).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mũi tên đứt xanh lá:&lt;/b&gt; Client Credentials từ secret store sang Spotify Web API (token ~1 giờ, docs &lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;expires_in=3600&lt;/font&gt;).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mũi tên đứt tím:&lt;/b&gt; backfill ReccoBeats khi &lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;features_found=false&lt;/font&gt;. Đứt xanh ngọc: ghi raw payload về Bronze.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Khung xanh lá nét đứt&lt;/b&gt; = giả định – cần xác nhận (auth/v0, scheduler, secret store, lake, BI).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Khung đỏ nét đứt&lt;/b&gt; = rủi ro: ToS Charts / endpoint không chính thức; ReccoBeats thiếu bài mới (#1–#6, 26/40); rate limit (Spotify 429, ReccoBeats 429 + Retry-After, ngưỡng không công bố).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Watermark&lt;/b&gt; = &lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;chart_date + chart_type + country&lt;/font&gt;. Silver luôn &lt;b&gt;LEFT JOIN&lt;/b&gt;. Endpoint Spotify bị khoá từ 27/11/2024 (&lt;font face=&#x27;Courier New&#x27;&gt;audio-features&lt;/font&gt;, recommendations, related-artists) &lt;b&gt;không dùng&lt;/b&gt; — feature lấy từ ReccoBeats." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fontColor=#37474F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="1100" width="1740" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="foot" value="Đã chốt nguồn 16/11/2026 (Asia/Bangkok). Docs đối chiếu cùng ngày: developer.spotify.com (Get Several Tracks/Artists/Albums, Client Credentials, changelog Feb/Mar 2026, blog 27/11/2024 và 06/02/2026). v1 (có kworb / Last.fm / Kaggle) giữ nguyên tại music-pipeline.drawio — sơ đồ này là v2." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=10;fontColor=#78909C;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1368" width="2600" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>
